19. Rates of Reaction: Change concentration, temperature, surface area, and catalyst, and watch gas production and a rate graph.
20. Organic Chemistry Basics: Build alkanes, alkenes, alcohols, and carboxylic acids in rotatable 3D and name them automatically.
21. Metals, Reactivity Series & Corrosion: Drop metals into acids and salt solutions and rank them. Test rusting conditions.
22. Water, Solutions & Solubility: Dissolve salts at different temperatures and plot solubility curves.

